Description: parallel security reconnaissance and enumeration CLI
 Enumeraga is a Go-based command-line scanner that coordinates nmap and
 protocol-specific security enumeration tools.  It supports bounded and
 unbounded infrastructure scans, optional cloud-provider workflows, tool
 output collection, and run-record generation.
 .
 The package installs the Kali Linux runtime tools used by the infrastructure
 scanner.  Optional cloud tools such as gcloud, prowler, ScoutSuite, and
 gcp-iam-brute are installed separately because they are not all available as
 Kali packages.
